    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσᾰγείρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>collect into</i> a place, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς</span> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristarch.
				</span></i>
			) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ᾽ ἐρέτας..ἀγείρομεν</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν νῆα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.142
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.349
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέον δ᾽ ἐσαγείρετο</span>
				(v.l.-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατο</span>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμόν</span> he <i>gathered</i> fresh courage, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.240
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.417
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θοῶς δ᾽ ἐσαγείρετο λαὸς [ἐς
				τὰς νῆας</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.248
			</span></i>.</div>
